  "demo-launch-sync": {
   "meeting": {
    "id": "demo-launch-sync",
    "title": "Self-serve launch sync",
    "status": "ended",
    "source": "demo",
    "started_at": 1792062000000,
    "ended_at": 1792062236310,
    "duration_s": 236.31,
    "utterance_count": 29,
    "speaker_count": 3,
    "has_audio": true,
    "summary": "Trackwise cut its small-shipper plan to 3,499, and trial accounts pushed back on price. Starter moves to 3,999 with 1,000 shipments, replacing Tuesday's decision; Rahul's numbers put the margin at 55 percent. The annual discount and the November 2 launch both hold."
   },
   "speakers": [
    {
     "track": "S1",
     "label": "Speaker 1",
     "name": "Priya",
     "person_id": "p-priya",
     "color_idx": 0,
     "utterance_count": 12,
     "talk_time_s": 85.0
    },
    {
     "track": "S2",
     "label": "Speaker 2",
     "name": "Meera",
     "person_id": "p-meera",
     "color_idx": 2,
     "utterance_count": 9,
     "talk_time_s": 67.3
    },
    {
     "track": "S3",
     "label": "Speaker 3",
     "name": "Rahul",
     "person_id": "p-rahul",
     "color_idx": 1,
     "utterance_count": 8,
     "talk_time_s": 65.0
    }
   ],
   "utterances": [
    {
     "id": "u-demo-launch-sync-000",
     "meeting_id": "demo-launch-sync",
     "seq": 0,
     "speaker": "S1",
     "speaker_name": "Priya",
     "t_start": 0.6,
     "t_end": 7.69,
     "text": "Quick launch sync. Arjun is heads down on the usage meter today, so it's the three of us. Meera, how did the deck land?",
     "confidence": 0.952
    },
    {
     "id": "u-demo-launch-sync-001",
     "meeting_id": "demo-launch-sync",
     "seq": 1,
     "speaker": "S2",
     "speaker_name": "Meera",
     "t_start": 8.29,
     "t_end": 15.27,
     "text": "The revised deck went to Saffron Basket yesterday, so that one is done. But their reaction to the Starter price was not great.",
     "confidence": 0.942
    },
    {
     "id": "u-demo-launch-sync-002",
     "meeting_id": "demo-launch-sync",
     "seq": 2,
     "speaker": "S3",
     "speaker_name": "Rahul",
     "t_start": 15.77,
     "t_end": 21.07,
     "text": "What did they actually say? Was it the price itself, or the shipment limit that bothered them?",
     "confidence": 0.982
    },
    {
     "id": "u-demo-launch-sync-003",
     "meeting_id": "demo-launch-sync",
     "seq": 3,
     "speaker": "S2",
     "speaker_name": "Meera",
     "t_start": 21.57,
     "t_end": 34.9,
     "text": "The price. Trackwise just cut its small-shipper plan from 3,999 to 3,499, so at 4,999 we're over forty percent more expensive.",
     "confidence": 0.98
    },
    {
     "id": "u-demo-launch-sync-004",
     "meeting_id": "demo-launch-sync",
     "seq": 4,
     "speaker": "S1",
     "speaker_name": "Priya",
     "t_start": 35.5,
     "t_end": 40.74,
     "text": "Is that just one customer pushing back, or are we hearing the same thing from other accounts?",
     "confidence": 0.978
    },
    {
     "id": "u-demo-launch-sync-005",
     "meeting_id": "demo-launch-sync",
     "seq": 5,
     "speaker": "S2",
     "speaker_name": "Meera",
     "t_start": 41.24,
     "t_end": 47.15,
     "text": "Other accounts too. Two of the five trial accounts that signed up this week asked for a price under four thousand.",
     "confidence": 0.969
    },
    {
     "id": "u-demo-launch-sync-006",
     "meeting_id": "demo-launch-sync",
     "seq": 6,
     "speaker": "S3",
     "speaker_name": "Rahul",
     "t_start": 47.95,
     "t_end": 59.33,
     "text": "I expected this, so I ran the numbers again last night. If Starter includes one thousand shipments instead of fifteen hundred, 3,999 still works.",
     "confidence": 0.953
    },
    {
     "id": "u-demo-launch-sync-007",
     "meeting_id": "demo-launch-sync",
     "seq": 7,
     "speaker": "S1",
     "speaker_name": "Priya",
     "t_start": 59.93,
     "t_end": 66.1,
     "text": "Walk us through it, because on Tuesday you said 3,999 was below your floor.",
     "confidence": 0.973
    },
    {
     "id": "u-demo-launch-sync-008",
     "meeting_id": "demo-launch-sync",
     "seq": 8,
     "speaker": "S3",
     "speaker_name": "Rahul",
     "t_start": 66.6,
     "t_end": 80.14,
     "text": "A thousand shipments cost us about eighteen hundred rupees. At 3,999 that's a 55 percent margin, which is better than the 46 percent we accepted on Tuesday.",
     "confidence": 0.968
    },
    {
     "id": "u-demo-launch-sync-009",
     "meeting_id": "demo-launch-sync",
     "seq": 9,
     "speaker": "S2",
     "speaker_name": "Meera",
     "t_start": 80.84,
     "t_end": 86.14,
     "text": "And heavy users still pay four rupees per shipment above a thousand, so the busy accounts are covered.",
     "confidence": 0.963
    },
    {
     "id": "u-demo-launch-sync-010",
     "meeting_id": "demo-launch-sync",
     "seq": 10,
     "speaker": "S1",
     "speaker_name": "Priya",
     "t_start": 86.74,
     "t_end": 92.26,
     "text": "My worry is that a thousand shipments looks small next to Trackwise. What does their plan include?",
     "confidence": 0.965
    },
    {
     "id": "u-demo-launch-sync-011",
     "meeting_id": "demo-launch-sync",
     "seq": 11,
     "speaker": "S2",
     "speaker_name": "Meera",
     "t_start": 92.76,
     "t_end": 100.34,
     "text": "The same thousand shipments. But they charge seven rupees for overage, so above about twelve hundred shipments a month we're the cheaper option.",
     "confidence": 0.988
    },
    {
     "id": "u-demo-launch-sync-012",
     "meeting_id": "demo-launch-sync",
     "seq": 12,
     "speaker": "S3",
     "speaker_name": "Rahul",
     "t_start": 101.04,
     "t_end": 109.53,
     "text": "Then I'm fine moving Starter to 3,999 with a thousand shipments. Overage stays at four rupees.",
     "confidence": 0.943
    },
    {
     "id": "u-demo-launch-sync-013",
     "meeting_id": "demo-launch-sync",
     "seq": 13,
     "speaker": "S1",
     "speaker_name": "Priya",
     "t_start": 110.13,
     "t_end": 122.57,
     "text": "Okay, let's change it. Starter moves from 4,999 to 3,999 a month, with one thousand shipments included. This replaces what we decided on Tuesday.",
     "confidence": 0.969
    },
    {
     "id": "u-demo-launch-sync-014",
     "meeting_id": "demo-launch-sync",
     "seq": 14,
     "speaker": "S2",
     "speaker_name": "Meera",
     "t_start": 123.37,
     "t_end": 128.02,
     "text": "Good. That makes my first calls a lot easier, especially when we're up against Trackwise.",
     "confidence": 0.966
    },
    {
     "id": "u-demo-launch-sync-015",
     "meeting_id": "demo-launch-sync",
     "seq": 15,
     "speaker": "S3",
     "speaker_name": "Rahul",
     "t_start": 128.52,
     "t_end": 133.5,
     "text": "The annual discount stays at fifteen percent, though. I don't want to reopen that one.",
     "confidence": 0.952
    },
    {
     "id": "u-demo-launch-sync-016",
     "meeting_id": "demo-launch-sync",
     "seq": 16,
     "speaker": "S1",
     "speaker_name": "Priya",
     "t_start": 134.1,
     "t_end": 138.81,
     "text": "Agreed, fifteen percent stands. So what has to change downstream before launch?",
     "confidence": 0.974
    },
    {
     "id": "u-demo-launch-sync-017",
     "meeting_id": "demo-launch-sync",
     "seq": 17,
     "speaker": "S3",
     "speaker_name": "Rahul",
     "t_start": 139.41,
     "t_end": 148.55,
     "text": "The Starter plan in Razorpay needs to change. I'll update it to 3,999 with the new shipment limit by Monday.",
     "confidence": 0.981
    },
    {
     "id": "u-demo-launch-sync-018",
     "meeting_id": "demo-launch-sync",
     "seq": 18,
     "speaker": "S1",
     "speaker_name": "Priya",
     "t_start": 149.25,
     "t_end": 158.18,
     "text": "And I'm still drafting the pricing page, so it'll go out with 3,999 and the thousand shipment cap. That's still on track for Monday.",
     "confidence": 0.959
    },
    {
     "id": "u-demo-launch-sync-019",
     "meeting_id": "demo-launch-sync",
     "seq": 19,
     "speaker": "S2",
     "speaker_name": "Meera",
     "t_start": 158.78,
     "t_end": 170.32,
     "text": "Change the FAQ example as well. Two thousand shipments on the new Starter would be 3,999 plus four thousand, so 7,999 rupees.",
     "confidence": 0.951
    },
    {
     "id": "u-demo-launch-sync-020",
     "meeting_id": "demo-launch-sync",
     "seq": 20,
     "speaker": "S1",
     "speaker_name": "Priya",
     "t_start": 170.92,
     "t_end": 178.51,
     "text": "Yes, I'll use that. Someone needs to tell Arjun, because the usage meter warning was set at ninety percent of fifteen hundred.",
     "confidence": 0.961
    },
    {
     "id": "u-demo-launch-sync-021",
     "meeting_id": "demo-launch-sync",
     "seq": 21,
     "speaker": "S3",
     "speaker_name": "Rahul",
     "t_start": 179.01,
     "t_end": 185.02,
     "text": "Ninety percent of a thousand is nine hundred. That's a config value, isn't it, not a rebuild?",
     "confidence": 0.98
    },
    {
     "id": "u-demo-launch-sync-022",
     "meeting_id": "demo-launch-sync",
     "seq": 22,
     "speaker": "S1",
     "speaker_name": "Priya",
     "t_start": 185.52,
     "t_end": 192.89,
     "text": "It should be config. I'll message Arjun today so the meter warns at nine hundred shipments, and he can still ship it on Friday.",
     "confidence": 0.937
    },
    {
     "id": "u-demo-launch-sync-023",
     "meeting_id": "demo-launch-sync",
     "seq": 23,
     "speaker": "S2",
     "speaker_name": "Meera",
     "t_start": 193.59,
     "t_end": 200.8,
     "text": "I'll email Saffron Basket and the two trial accounts with the new Starter price by tomorrow morning, ahead of their renewal call.",
     "confidence": 0.934
    },
    {
     "id": "u-demo-launch-sync-024",
     "meeting_id": "demo-launch-sync",
     "seq": 24,
     "speaker": "S1",
     "speaker_name": "Priya",
     "t_start": 201.6,
     "t_end": 205.72,
     "text": "Does the November second launch date still hold with all of these changes?",
     "confidence": 0.973
    },
    {
     "id": "u-demo-launch-sync-025",
     "meeting_id": "demo-launch-sync",
     "seq": 25,
     "speaker": "S3",
